exports[`TemplateDirectorPanel without editSheet (flag off) keeps its markup > collapsed, Korean, no customizations 1`] = `"<div data-template-director-panel="true" data-director-expanded="false" data-template-archetype="default-editorial" class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 text-[#09090B]"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><button type="button" data-director-toggle="true" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_0_-drawer" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-xs font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B] border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white text-[#52525B] hover:border-[#09090B] hover:text-[#09090B]"><span>+ 의상 · 메이크업 · 장면 조금 바꾸기</span></button></div><div id="_R_0_-drawer" hidden="" data-director-island="true" class="rounded-[20px] border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white p-4 transition-colors"><p class="text-xs leading-[1.6] text-[#71717A]">템플릿에 고정된 기본 스타일을 확인하고, 내 취향에 맞지 않는 의상·메이크업·헤어·표정을 사진이나 한 줄 요청으로 자연스럽게 바꿔보세요.</p><section data-template-baseline-card="default-editorial" aria-label="이 템플릿의 고정 연출 · 맞춤 변경 범위" class="mt-3 rounded-[16px] border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-[#F4F4F5] p-3.5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><h3 data-template-baseline-title="true" class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#09090B]">이 템플릿의 고정 연출 · 맞춤 변경 범위</h3><span class="rounded-full bg-white px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[0.68rem] font-medium text-[#52525B]">기본 고정 · 변경 안내</span></div><div class="mt-2.5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2"><div data-baseline-slot="outfit" data-baseline-slot-state="default" class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-1.5 rounded-[14px] border p-2.5 transition-colors border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white"><div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-1.5"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] font-semibold text-[#52525B] uppercase">기본 착장</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><button type="button" data-baseline-customize="outfit" class="rounded-full border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-[#F4F4F5] px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[0.68rem] font-medium text-[#09090B] hover:border-[#09090B] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B]">이 항목 바꾸기</button></div></div><p class="mt-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#09090B]">템플릿 시그니처 착장 (시안의 기본 의상 적용)</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[0.72rem] leading-[1.45] text-[#71717A]">원하는 옷 사진을 올리거나 텍스트로 드레스·수트·자켓 스타일을 지정할 수 있어요</p></div></div><div data-baseline-slot="makeup" data-baseline-slot-state="default" class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-1.5 rounded-[14px] border p-2.5 transition-colors border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white"><div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-1.5"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] font-semibold text-[#52525B] uppercase">기본 메이크업 · 피부 톤</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><button type="button" data-baseline-customize="makeup" class="rounded-full border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-[#F4F4F5] px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[0.68rem] font-medium text-[#09090B] hover:border-[#09090B] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B]">이 항목 바꾸기</button></div></div><p class="mt-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#09090B]">템플릿 무드 메이크업 · 매트 새틴 피부결</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[0.72rem] leading-[1.45] text-[#71717A]">진한 화장이 어색하면 내 사진 속 데일리 메이크업·맑은 피부톤 그대로 유지하도록 바꿀 수 있어요</p></div></div><div data-baseline-slot="hair" data-baseline-slot-state="default" class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-1.5 rounded-[14px] border p-2.5 transition-colors border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white"><div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-1.5"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] font-semibold text-[#52525B] uppercase">기본 헤어 · 머리 소품</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><button type="button" data-baseline-customize="hair" class="rounded-full border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-[#F4F4F5] px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[0.68rem] font-medium text-[#09090B] hover:border-[#09090B] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B]">이 항목 바꾸기</button></div></div><p class="mt-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#09090B]">내 사진 속 헤어스타일 반영 (사진 속 안경·선글라스 자동 제외)</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[0.72rem] leading-[1.45] text-[#71717A]">앞머리(시스루뱅/사이드뱅)나 긴 생머리 고정, 머리 위 선글라스·장식 제거를 지정할 수 있어요</p></div></div><div data-baseline-slot="shot_action" data-baseline-slot-state="default" class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-1.5 rounded-[14px] border p-2.5 transition-colors border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white"><div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-1.5"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] font-semibold text-[#52525B] uppercase">기본 표정 · 입 모양</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><button type="button" data-baseline-customize="shot_action" class="rounded-full border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-[#F4F4F5] px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[0.68rem] font-medium text-[#09090B] hover:border-[#09090B] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B]">이 항목 바꾸기</button></div></div><p class="mt-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#09090B]">시크한 오프축 시선 · 입을 크게 벌리지 않는 차분한 표정</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[0.72rem] leading-[1.45] text-[#71717A]">센 인상이 부담스러우면 부드러운 반미소와 편안한 눈빛으로 바꿀 수 있어요</p></div></div></div><div data-template-locked-elements="true" class="mt-2.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 border-t border-[#E4E4E7] pt-2.5"><span class="font-mono text-[0.66rem] font-semibold text-[#71717A] uppercase">템플릿 고정 (변경 불가):</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[0.7rem] text-[#71717A]">카메라 렌즈 · 컷 전환 리듬</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[0.7rem] text-[#71717A]">공간 배경 · 조명 무드</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border borde