exports[`TemplateDirectorPanel without editSheet (flag off) keeps its markup > expanded with chips, a template and a video spec 1`] = `"<div data-template-director-panel="true" data-director-expanded="true" data-template-archetype="90s-apgujeong-interview" class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 text-[#09090B]"><section data-video-resolution-tiers="true" data-selected-resolution="720p" data-selected-resolution-credits="345" data-selected-resolution-krw="4000" aria-label="영상 화질 선택 (480p · 720p · 1080p)" class="rounded-[20px] border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-[#F4F4F5] p-4"><input type="hidden" data-video-resolution-input="true" name="videoResolution" value="720p"/><div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-2"><div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-white px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.68rem] font-semibold text-[#09090B] tabular-nums"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#FF58AE]"></span>영상 화질 선택 (720p)</span><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#52525B]">의상·연출 변경이나 얼굴 닮음새가 궁금할 땐 가벼운 480p Draft로 먼저 확인하고, 일상 업로드는 선명한 720p, 최고 소장본은 1080p로 선택하세요.</p></div><span data-draft-savings-pill="true" class="rounded-full border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[0.68rem] font-semibold text-[#CC1573] tabular-nums">480p Draft · 본 영상 대비 55% 절약</span></div><div role="radiogroup" aria-label="영상 화질 등급" class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-3"><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-resolution-tier-option="480p" data-resolution-tier-credits="154" data-resolution-tier-selected="false" class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-2 rounded-[16px] border p-3 text-left transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B] border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white/60 hover:border-[#09090B] hover:bg-white"><div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-1.5"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#09090B] tabular-nums">480p</span><span class="rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.62rem] font-semibold bg-[#F4F4F5] text-[#52525B]">Draft 모드 · 720p/1080p 전 가벼운 테스트</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold text-[#09090B]">480p Draft (사전 테스트)</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[0.72rem] leading-[1.45] text-[#52525B]">본 영상 전 얼굴 닮음새·의상 변경 가볍게 확인 (55% 절약)</p></div><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between border-t border-[#E4E4E7] pt-2 font-mono tabular-nums"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#09090B]">1,800원</span><span class="text-[0.68rem] text-[#71717A]">Draft 모드 · 720p/1080p 전 가벼운 테스트</span></div></button><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="true" data-resolution-tier-option="720p" data-resolution-tier-credits="345" data-resolution-tier-selected="true" class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-2 rounded-[16px] border p-3 text-left transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B] border-[#09090B] bg-white"><div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-1.5"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#09090B] tabular-nums">720p</span><span class="rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.62rem] font-semibold bg-[#09090B] text-white">기본 추천 · 충분히 좋은 영상 퀄리티</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold text-[#09090B]">720p 고화질 (스탠다드 본편)</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[0.72rem] leading-[1.45] text-[#52525B]">릴스·틱톡 업로드에 충분히 선명한 표준 고화질</p></div><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between border-t border-[#E4E4E7] pt-2 font-mono tabular-nums"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#09090B]">4,000원</span><span class="text-[0.68rem] text-[#71717A]">기본 추천 · 충분히 좋은 영상 퀄리티</span></div></button><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-resolution-tier-option="1080p" data-resolution-tier-credits="847" data-resolution-tier-selected="false" class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-2 rounded-[16px] border p-3 text-left transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B] border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white/60 hover:border-[#09090B] hover:bg-white"><div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-1.5"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#09090B] tabular-nums">1080p</span><span class="rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.62rem] font-semibold bg-[#F4F4F5] text-[#52525B]">최고 퀄리티 마스터 · 하이엔드</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold text-[#09090B]">1080p 마스터 (최고 화질)</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[0.72rem] leading-[1.45] text-[#52525B]">피부결·패브릭 디테일까지 극대화한 플래그십 최고 화질</p></div><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between border-t border-[#E4E4E7] pt-2 font-mono tabular-nums"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#09090B]">9,700원</span><span class="text-[0.68rem] text-[#71717A]">최고 퀄리티 마스터 · 하이엔드</span></div></button></div></section><section data-director-audio-toggle="true" aria-label="영상 사운드 설정" class="rounded-[20px] border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white p-3.5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#09090B]">영상 사운드 설정</span><div class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-[#F4F4F5] p-0.5"><button type="button" data-audio-mode-option="ambient" aria-pressed="true" class="rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[0.72rem] transition-colors bg-[#09090B] font-semibold text-white focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B]">현장음 · 목소리만 (기본)</button><button type="button" data-audio-mode-option="bgm" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[0.72rem] transition-colors font-medium text-[#52525B] hover:text-[#09090B] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B]">어울리는 배경음악 함께 생성</button></div></div><div data-personal-no-bgm-notice="true" class="mt-2.5 flex items-start gap-2 rounded-[10px] bg-[#F4F4F5] px-3 py-2 text-xs text-[#52525B]"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.65rem] font-semibold text-[#09090B]">현장음 기본</span><p class="leading-[1.5]">인스타그램·틱톡 업로드 시 원하는 음악을 바로 입히실 수 있도록, 배경음악(BGM) 없이 현장 효과음과 자연스러운 사운드만 담아 제작됩니다.</p></div></section><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><button type="button" data-director-toggle="true" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="_R_0_-drawer" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-xs font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B] border-[#09090B] bg-[#F4F4F5] text-[#09090B]"><span>장면 바꾸기 접기</span><span data-director-chip-count="true" class="inline-flex min-w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#FF58AE] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.68rem] font-bold text-[#09090B] tabular-nums">2</span></button><button type="button" data-director-reset="true" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full px-3 text-xs text-[#71717A] underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-[#09090B] disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B]">원본 설정으로 초기화</button></div><div data-director-summary-chips="true" aria-label="적용된 커스텀 설정" class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5"><span data-director-chip="outfit" class="inline-flex min-h-9 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#09090B] py-1 pr-1 pl-3.5 text-xs font-medium text-white"><span class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] text-white/75 uppercase">의상</span><span>· 크림 트위드 자켓</span><button type="button" data-director-chip-remove="0" aria-label="의상 크림 트위드 자켓 설정 해제" class="inline-flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-sm text-white/80 hover:bg-white/15 hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B]">×</button></span><span data-director-chip="shot_action" class="inline-flex min-h-9 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#09090B] py-1 pr-1 pl-3.5 text-xs font-medium text-white"><span class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] text-white/75 uppercase">연출</span><span>· 마지막 컷에서 미소</span><button type="button" data-director-chip-remove="1" aria-label="연출 마지막 컷에서 미소 설정 해제" class="inline-flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-sm text-white/80 hover:bg-white/15 hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B]">×</button></span></div><div id="_R_0_-drawer" data-director-island="true" class="rounded-[20px] border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white p-4 transition-colors"><p class="text-xs leading-[1.6] text-[#71717A]">템플릿에 고정된 기본 스타일을 확인하고, 내 취향에 맞지 않는 의상·메이크업·헤어·표정을 사진이나 한 줄 요청으로 자연스럽게 바꿔보세요.</p><section data-template-baseline-card="90s-apgujeong-interview" aria-label="90년대 압구정 인터뷰 템플릿 · 기본 설정 안내" class="mt-3 rounded-[16px] border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-[#F4F4F5] p-3.5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><h3 data-template-baseline-title="true" class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#09090B]">90년대 압구정 인터뷰 템플릿 · 기본 설정 안내</h3><span class="rounded-full bg-white px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[0.68rem] font-medium text-[#52525B]">기본 고정 · 변경 안내</span></div><div class="mt-2.5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2"><div data-baseline-slot="outfit" data-baseline-slot-state="customized" class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-1.5 rounded-[14px] border p-2.5 transition-colors border-[#09090B] bg-[#F4F4F5]"><div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-1.5"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] font-semibold text-[#52525B] uppercase">기본 착장</span><span data-baseline-customized-badge="outfit" class="rounded-full bg-[#FF58AE] px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.62rem] font-bold text-[#09090B]">맞춤 적용됨</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><button type="button" data-baseline-revert="outfit" class="rounded-full border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.66rem] font-medium text-[#52525B] hover:border-[#09090B] hover:text-[#09090B] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B]">기본값 복원</button><button type="button" data-baseline-customize="outfit" class="rounded-full border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-[#F4F4F5] px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[0.68rem] font-medium text-[#09090B] hover:border-[#09090B] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B]">이 항목 바꾸기</button></div></div><p class="mt-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#71717A] line-through">94년 압구정 블랙 가죽 재킷 · 차콜 팬츠 · 삐삐 벨트</p><p data-baseline-active-override="outfit" class="mt-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-[#09090B]">→ 크림 트위드 자켓</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[0.72rem] leading-[1.45] text-[#71717A]">오프화이트 블레이저·셔츠 룩이나 내가 올린 의상 레퍼런스 사진으로 바꿀 수 있어요</p></div></div><div data-baseline-slot="makeup" data-baseline-slot-state="default" class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-1.5 rounded-[14px] border p-2.5 transition-colors border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white"><div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-1.5"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] font-semibold text-[#52525B] uppercase">기본 메이크업 · 피부 톤</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><button type="button" data-baseline-customize="makeup" class="rounded-full border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-[#F4F4F5] px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[0.68rem] font-medium text-[#09090B] hover:border-[#09090B] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B]">이 항목 바꾸기</button></div></div><p class="mt-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#09090B]">94년 레트로 딥 플럼 버건디 매트 립 &amp; 세미 스모키 음영</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[0.72rem] leading-[1.45] text-[#71717A]">90년대 진한 화장이 세 보이면 내 원래 눈화장·맑은 피부톤을 유지하고 입술만 은은하게 바꿀 수 있어요</p></div></div><div data-baseline-slot="hair" data-baseline-slot-state="default" class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-1.5 rounded-[14px] border p-2.5 transition-colors border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white"><div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-1.5"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] font-semibold text-[#52525B] uppercase">기본 헤어 · 머리 소품</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><button type="button" data-baseline-customize="hair" class="rounded-full border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-[#F4F4F5] px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[0.68rem] font-medium text-[#09090B] hover:border-[#09090B] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B]">이 항목 바꾸기</button></div></div><p class="mt-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#09090B]">내 사진 속 헤어스타일 + 정수리 위 90년대 오벌 선글라스</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[0.72rem] leading-[1.45] text-[#71717A]">머리 위 선글라스를 빼거나 내 사진의 앞머리·생머리 스타일로 고정할 수 있어요</p></div></div><div data-baseline-slot="shot_action" data-baseline-slot-state="customized" class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-1.5 rounded-[14px] border p-2.5 transition-colors border-[#09090B] bg-[#F4F4F5]"><div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-1.5"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] font-semibold text-[#52525B] uppercase">기본 표정 · 립싱크</span><span data-baseline-customized-badge="shot_action" class="rounded-full bg-[#FF58AE] px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.62rem] font-bold text-[#09090B]">맞춤 적용됨</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><button type="button" data-baseline-revert="shot_action" class="rounded-full border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.66rem] font-medium text-[#52525B] hover:border-[#09090B] hover:text-[#09090B] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B]">기본값 복원</button><button type="button" data-baseline-customize="shot_action" class="rounded-full border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-[#F4F4F5] px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[0.68rem] font-medium text-[#09090B] hover:border-[#09090B] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B]">이 항목 바꾸기</button></div></div><p class="mt-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#71717A] line-through">차분한 입 모양 립싱크 · 7.8초 당당한 미소</p><p data-baseline-active-override="shot_action" class="mt-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-[#09090B]">→ 마지막 컷에서 미소</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[0.72rem] leading-[1.45] text-[#71717A]">입을 크게 벌리지 않는 절제된 발음과 부드러운 인상으로 하관 왜곡을 막아줘요</p></div></div></div><div data-template-locked-elements="true" class="mt-2.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 border-t border-[#E4E4E7] pt-2.5"><span class="font-mono text-[0.66rem] font-semibold text-[#71717A] uppercase">템플릿 고정 (변경 불가):</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[0.7rem] text-[#71717A]">1994년 압구정 로데오 거리 · 아날로그 캠코더 질감</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[0.7rem] text-[#71717A]">기자 질문(0~1.8초) 후 3문장 인터뷰 대사 타이밍</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[0.7rem] text-[#71717A]">8.0초 플래시 컷 · 클래식 블랙 세단 드라이빙 엔딩</span></div></section><div data-director-predictive-presets="true" class="mt-3.5"><p class="text-[0.72rem] font-semibold text-[#52525B]">가장 많이 요청하는 맞춤 변경 (원클릭 적용)</p><div class="mt-1.5 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5"><button type="button" data-predictive-preset="makeup-daily-clean" data-predictive-slot="makeup" data-preset-active="false" aria-pressed="false" class="inline-flex min-h-9 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-3 py-1 text-xs transition-colors disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B] border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white text-[#09090B] hover:border-[#09090B] hover:bg-[#F4F4F5]"><span class="rounded-full px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.62rem] font-semibold bg-[#F4F4F5] text-[#52525B]">인상 왜곡 방지 1위</span><span>진한 화장 빼고 내 평소 데일리 메이크업 유지</span></button><button type="button" data-predictive-preset="makeup-no-pink-blush" data-predictive-slot="makeup" data-preset-active="false" aria-pressed="false" class="inline-flex min-h-9 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-3 py-1 text-xs transition-colors disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#09090B]